Diagnostic query

This keeps the Claims filter but drops the status and entity filters, so we can see what's actually there:

fetch dt.davis.problems, from:-30d
| sort timestamp desc
| dedup display_id
| filter dt.davis.is_duplicate == false
| filter contains(lower(event.name), "process unavailable")
      or contains(lower(event.name), "low instance count")
| expand tag = entity_tags
| filter startsWith(tag, "APMID:")
| fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1]
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
| dedup display_id
| fieldsAdd idPrefix = splitString(toString(affected_entity_ids), "-")[0]
| summarize problems = count(), by:{event.status, event.name, idPrefix}
